WEBVTT

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:09.220
With my powerful magic goods, I'll wring out every last cent from those foolish humans!

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:16.740
I've got a lock on becoming the next Queen!

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:19.980
The battle has already been decided, Majo Rika.

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:55.470
Welcome, welcome!

00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:58.450
We've got all kindsa cute and wonderful items!

00:01:58.450 --> 00:02:00.930
They'll bring you happiness!

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:03.040
Sounds interesting.

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:04.570
Let's go check it out.

00:02:04.570 --> 00:02:05.770
Welcome!

00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:11.690
I don't find this cute at all.

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:12.480
What?

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:15.960
Well, maybe we should just buy it anyway...

00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:19.700
But for the same money, we could go to the Original Maho-dou and...

00:02:20.180 --> 00:02:21.320
They're Majo Ruka's lackies!

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:24.540
Stop getting in the way of our business, and get out!

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:26.320
Ooh, scary.

00:02:26.320 --> 00:02:29.250
Such a vulgar shop really is a waste of space, isn't it?

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:31.460
GET OUT NOW!!

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:36.270
Yeah, that's right. I heard about the Original Maho-dou from my friend.

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:39.260
They have good luck charms that really work!

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:41.320
Oh? Where's that?

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:42.820
Let's get over there right now and check it out!

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:48.170
But...

00:02:48.170 --> 00:02:50.960
What the... We finally got some people in here and they all left without buying anything!

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:53.980
You dolt! You have no talent as a salesperson!

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:02.530
Majo Ruka's Goods are Super Dangerous.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:09.490
Hey, Majo Rika. I got somethin' I wanna ask...

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:10.960
What?

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:15.330
That person just said that Majo Ruka's goods actually worked.

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:16.720
Is that fer real?

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:21.060
Majo Rika, why aren't you answering?

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:22.930
Was I right on the money?

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:25.560
Well, just think about it.

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:28.520
When you compare the goods you witch apprentices make,

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:31.400
with the goods made by a real witch like Majo Ruka,

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:33.350
which ones do you think would be more effective?

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:35.520
The ones Majo Ruka made.

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:37.530
Then, there's no way we could win...

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:39.670
in the first place!

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:42.280
Then why don't you make the goods, Majo Rika?

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:45.240
I-I'm sorry, but I can't do that.

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:46.660
Why?

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:50.520
Isn't it necessary to take back the Original Maho-dou?

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:51.550
Yeah.

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:54.080
No means no means no!

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:55.000
Why?

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:58.500
To make magic goods, you need to use a hair from the head.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:03:59.800
Quiet, Lala!

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:01.430
A hair from the head?

00:04:01.430 --> 00:04:06.100
I see... You only have one hair left, Majo Rika.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.010
Shut up! Leave me alone.

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:12.940
But if you use it, you can make effective magic goods, right!?

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:15.150
Shall we?

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:17.480
Long black hair is the life of a maiden!

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:20.110
I won't let you lay a finger on my last hair!

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:22.030
Maiden?

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.670
Welcome!

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:27.990
Thank you very much!

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:30.010
They're doing well.

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:31.480
Really...

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:33.970
Their business is boomin'.

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.670
They're even popular with everyone in our class.

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:40.130
It's Tamaki Reika!

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:42.800
What do you want?

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:48.660
I figured there was no way you were selling anything, so I came to check you out. It seems I was right!

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:50.520
Just as I figured.

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:52.970
You have something to say?

00:04:52.970 --> 00:04:58.440
I guess with a store that looks like that, there's no way you could sell anything.

00:04:58.440 --> 00:04:59.980
What did you say!?

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:02.440
How dare you say somethin' like that!

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:03.490
That's mean!

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:07.690
Welcome, Reika-sama.

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:09.450
What might you be looking for today?

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:12.410
Hmm, good question.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:16.120
I think this over here would suit you perfectly, ma'am.

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:18.580
Please, go ahead, have a look.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:20.840
Ueeghh, that pseudo-charming voice...

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:21.750
So that's her style!

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:24.470
Oh?

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:25.540
What?

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:28.140
Ain't that Majo Rika and Lala by the window?

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:29.180
No way...

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:31.140
Spying on the enemy, maybe?

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:36.090
Makes me sick...

00:05:36.090 --> 00:05:38.960
I'd rather be with Doremi and her friends!

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:41.070
But it's pretty effective.

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:44.570
Why would customers go into a store with such bad taste!?

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:48.040
Well, when it comes to bad taste, you're no better.

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:48.820
What did you say?

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:49.870
Oh, nothing...

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:52.490
My shop...

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:54.040
What has it become?

00:05:54.040 --> 00:06:00.290
Majo Rika, don't worry. If you can take back the shop, you and Doremi and her friends can make a new shop.

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:04.840
But how long would it take relying on those girls?

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:06.170
However!

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:13.260
I really feel sorry for you being in such a stupid looking body as that.

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:14.600
I pity you!

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:16.810
Damn you!

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:22.190
Well, now I'm sure to become the next Queen!

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:25.440
Don't get angry here, Majo Rika. You'll just lose.

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:26.990
I know...

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:30.360
What's with the frog?

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:34.110
It's super ugly!

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:37.610
Calm down!

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:42.930
They're coming this way.

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:47.840
What're YOU staring at!?

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:50.640
At this rate, we'll lose to Majo Ruka!

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:52.970
You've got to sell a buttload more!

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:54.810
Are you girls even into it!?

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:58.500
What's this all of a sudden?

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:00.950
Did something happen at Majo Ruka's shop?

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:03.270
Shut up!

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:05.690
Such a loud voice...

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.380
I think she broke my eardrums...

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:09.200
What's the deal, Lala?

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:11.160
It's just as you think.

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:14.780
Were you bad mouthed by Majo Ruka?

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:19.320
So we can use your hair after all, Majo Rika?

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:20.160
Nope.

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:22.880
So, shall we return to Doremi's house?

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.910
Huh? My house?

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:28.750
Why? Didn't we make this Maho-dou so you could live here?

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:32.780
No way, I can't live in a place with no bathroom or TV.

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:33.950
Are you for real?

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:35.850
Just how long do you plan on living at my place?

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:39.060
Until we take back the Maho-dou, of course.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:45.520
Keep those spirits up, Doremi-chan!

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:46.730
Do your best!

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:05.250
And now, a hair.

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:26.020
Since Majo Rika only has one hair left, she can no longer make any magic goods.

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:28.350
This battle is already over.

00:08:29.030 --> 00:08:32.240
At this rate we can't take the Maho-dou back!

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:35.660
The way things are goin' we're probably gonna hafta buy it back.

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:38.950
Working hard seems to be the most certain way...

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:43.860
But how long would we have to work to buy back the Maho-dou?

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:48.710
Well, we hafta take it one step at a time.

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:52.210
Y-Yeah, that's all we know how to do for now.

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:54.340
Good morning, ladies!

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:01.810
T-Tamaki...

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:04.440
She's normally pretty garish, but today's she's especially flashy.

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:12.150
My, before my exquisite beauty, you would get dizzy and be at a loss for words, wouldn't you?

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:14.200
Do not worry, for that is simply natural!

00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:19.080
And also, those goods from the Original Maho-dou are great!

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:23.660
My mother bought me every piece of clothing I wanted!

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:30.940
Well, it's only appropriate that MY clothes be this gorgeous, right?

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:35.510
Could this be the effect of Majo Ruka's magic?

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:37.430
Could be, yup.

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:43.020
Wonderful!

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:44.430
Wonderful?

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:46.420
She said what?

00:09:46.420 --> 00:09:47.520
What's with that?

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:50.180
What the?

00:09:50.180 --> 00:09:51.230
She looks like an idiot.

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:53.940
It seems like her intensity has grown.

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:57.950
She's really confident.

00:09:57.950 --> 00:10:00.410
It makes me kind of jealous.

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:01.790
What did you say?

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:06.760
YOU are jealous of ME?

00:10:06.760 --> 00:10:08.540
Well, I AM quite popular.

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:12.800
If you'd like, I will give you advice on how to be this pretty and popular.

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:14.420
Not interested.

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:15.630
Can you really show me?

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:17.680
Oh, no need to be shy!

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:20.930
I'll help you out any time!

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:22.530
Just ask!

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:24.970
I said we ain't interested!

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:48.500
Ehhhhhh?

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.710
Fried bread again?

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:53.250
Ya get tired of it over and over again.

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.460
Yeah...

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:56.630
I can eat it if you want me to.

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:58.250
Really?

00:10:58.250 --> 00:10:59.680
Ah, mine too?

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:00.340
And mine?

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:03.300
And mine! Me too! Here's mine!

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:07.240
I wouldn't mind it if it was fried bread every day.

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:12.780
Is he going to eat everyone's bread?

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:15.000
He's somethin' else, that's fer sure.

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:19.240
Today's weather is sunny, bunny!

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:20.700
Busted by the bunnies!

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:21.780
Because all they do is multiply!

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:26.610
They're laughing at the SOS?

00:11:26.610 --> 00:11:27.860
Well, lookit that...

00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:30.340
Honestly, it seems like they're lacking a big finish.

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:33.920
Ahh! I'm stiff!

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:39.380
It's all Majo Ruka's fault I have to stay in such a cramped place!

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:43.840
And who was it, exactly, that decided to bet the deed to the shop?

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:45.710
Did you say something?

00:11:45.710 --> 00:11:47.650
No, I didn't say anything.

00:11:47.650 --> 00:11:49.890
Anyway, I'm starving.

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:02.140
What's this?

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:03.860
We can't afford luxury, you know.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:08.200
No! I want a more delicious dinner instead! Dinner!!!

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:10.160
But you're hungry, right?

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:17.500
I guess eating like this sometimes is fine too.

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:18.320
Right?

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:21.590
I'm thirsty.

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:22.610
Dodo!

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:24.900
Go get me something to drink.

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:34.880
I'm home!

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:37.230
Pop...?

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:38.230
What?

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:40.350
Did you just get home?

00:12:40.350 --> 00:12:41.000
Yeah.

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:44.200
But I thought I heard someone here a second ago.

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:45.530
Someone?

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:49.370
The anpan roll that was here before I left is gone!

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:52.330
Huh, and the milk is gone too.

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:54.160
Pop, did you drink it?

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:55.480
No, I didn't!

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:57.500
There's no glass!

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:01.630
But Dodo can only do so much...

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:03.420
How do you expect me to drink it?

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:07.290
Fine, fine... We'll help you drink it, so...

00:13:07.290 --> 00:13:08.770
Dodo, help me out.

00:13:16.150 --> 00:13:17.480
DODO!!!!

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:27.030
I'm home!

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:28.740
I'm starving!

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:34.460
W-What is it?

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:36.520
You see...

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:38.170
My anpan roll's gone...

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:41.670
I wonder if Majo Rika ate it?

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:42.840
Did you eat it?

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:44.850
I-I did! I ate it!

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:46.830
And how did you do that?

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:49.960
You've been at school the whole time, right?

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:53.060
I came home once just a while ago, and that's when I ate it!

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:56.980
Oh? I see. Then, the milk?

00:13:58.360 --> 00:14:00.230
You spilled it in your room!

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:04.740
Oh, oh! Oh that? I just kinda tripped, see...

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:11.620
Don't tell Mom, 'kay?

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:13.910
Fine!

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:15.220
You owe me one.

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:16.660
T-Thank you.

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:22.340
Don't just do whatever you want!

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:24.900
Well, I was hungry!

00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:27.650
You're making it look like I'm sneaking food!

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:30.260
And more importantly, what if Pop finds out?

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:31.680
What about Pop?

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:37.100
If you're so worried about your little sister, do you think you can really take back the Maho-dou?

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:41.810
Wait a minute, whose fault was it that the shop was lost in the first place again?

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:45.230
Well, it wasn't my fault, it was just bad luck!

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:46.780
That's a lame excuse.

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:48.070
Now, now...

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:50.910
I'm so mad...

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:52.490
What's the matter, Doremi-chan?

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:53.950
Is something wrong?

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:55.840
It's just her, dangit!

00:14:55.840 --> 00:14:59.120
I can't stand Majo Rika doing whatever she wants!

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:02.080
Oh, so yer havin' a fight with Majo Rika?

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:07.090
We've got to hurry up and take back the Maho-dou so Majo Rika can get the heck out of my house!

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:09.380
Yeah, sounds good to me.

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:10.760
Let's do our best, okay?

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:16.430
Yesterday was raining...

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:18.100
raining, waving...

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:20.350
when you get dumped then it starts pouring!

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:24.270
They're laughing at them.

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:25.760
Even durin' school.

00:15:25.760 --> 00:15:28.130
They aren't as funny as they usually are.

00:15:28.130 --> 00:15:28.860
They're usually...

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:30.180
...funny?

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:33.940
It really must be because of Majo Ruka's magic goods!

00:15:33.940 --> 00:15:36.500
Oh but what a strong effect they seem to have.

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:45.960
Won-der-ful!

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:49.300
If you have some fried bread you don't want, bring it here.

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:51.260
I'll eat it all for you.

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:54.840
Ah, this dizziness is...

00:15:54.840 --> 00:15:57.430
Is this from being so beautiful, perhaps?

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:00.480
What's all this?

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:02.640
We've got to take her to the nurse.

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:04.400
Yeah, I'll take her.

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:11.400
What's happening all of a sudden?

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:15.220
Maybe she made herself sick wearin' such heavy clothes?

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:18.330
It isn't just Tamaki that feels bad.

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:21.710
Are you okay?

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:23.750
Ah, that's...

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.460
I feel sick...

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.210
You just ate too much!

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:32.050
For me, there's no such thing as eating too much...

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:37.050
I've eaten 54 pieces of fried bread in a row before and I didn't have any problems.

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:39.590
54 pieces of fried bread?

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:44.770
Yanagida-kun, do you by chance have any goods from the Original Maho-dou?

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:48.570
Do you mean this?

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:58.120
Majo Ruka's magic goods don't just have strong effects, they also have strong side-effects.

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:00.660
That's probably why everyone feels bad.

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:02.190
As we thought.

00:17:02.190 --> 00:17:05.750
So then, how're we gonna rid of the effects from Majo Ruka's magic goods?

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:07.170
Please tell us.

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:12.340
There's no way you could dispel the effects with the power you have now.

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:13.570
There's no way?

00:17:13.570 --> 00:17:15.260
What about Magical Stage?

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:17.150
For you girls, impossible.

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:22.770
Then what about your magic, Majo Rika?

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:26.350
That's right! If ya use that hair of yers then you could beat her fer sure!

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:32.190
When it comes to magic goods, only the person who created them can dispel their effects.

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:35.530
But if everyone combined their powers, couldn't you do something?

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:36.820
Really?

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:38.690
Then, will you help us?

00:17:38.690 --> 00:17:42.380
Why should I use magic for something like that!?

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:50.000
It's their fault in the first place for relying on Majo Ruka's goods!

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:53.010
It's their business, and has nothing to do with me!

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:57.590
Fine! If you say no, we'll do our best with the power we have!

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:58.720
Yeah!

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:02.850
No way! Don't waste magic spheres like that!

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:05.730
What is with you!? Majo Rika, you stingy worm!

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:07.310
Stin...gy?

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:08.150
Idiot!

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:09.730
Idi...ot?

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:10.560
Demon!

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:19.530
Wow... I didn't think Majo Rika was that heartless.

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:22.450
Is this really okay, Majo Rika?

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:30.580
Hey, it might not work, but...

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:31.210
Yeah.

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:32.670
Let's try it.

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:35.250
We can't let things stay the way they are.

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:36.340
Yeah.

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:52.540
Pretty Witchy Aiko-chi!

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:55.950
Pretty Witchy Hadzuki-chi!

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:59.700
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:19:00.230 --> 00:19:02.590
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:07.590
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:11.590
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:15.330
Magical Stage!

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:26.700
Make the power disappear from the magic goods everyone bought from Majo Ruka!

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:33.150
It's disappearing!

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:35.980
At this rate, we won't be able to save Tamaki and the others!

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:38.440
Please, save everyone!

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:44.870
Please...

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:47.330
Please hear our wish...

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:49.040
Please!

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:18.820
Reika, now that I think about it, those clothes are a bit adult for an elementary school student.

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:27.170
I feel better all of a sudden.

00:20:27.170 --> 00:20:31.290
Susumu! We're out of fried bread today, is rice okay?

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:33.080
Fine with me!

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:37.170
Tomorrow will surely be snow, yo!

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:39.340
In that case it's time for

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:40.340
foxy udon!

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:42.050
Lame...

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:45.750
I could come up with better jokes than that!

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:55.090
I wonder if everyone's back to normal?

00:20:55.090 --> 00:20:56.060
Yeah, I wonder?

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:58.260
Of course they're back to normal!

00:20:58.260 --> 00:21:04.210
I lent you my power, so there's nothing to worry about.

00:21:04.210 --> 00:21:05.030
Majo Rika.

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:06.480
So ya came.

00:21:06.480 --> 00:21:08.030
You lent us your power?

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.160
What are you girls doing?

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:12.000
Quit loafing around on the job!

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:14.870
Hurry up and make that Majo Ruka pay!

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:17.920
Get out there and sell all those goods!

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:22.490
That's what she says, but she's really just worried about you girls.

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:25.840
Thank you, Majo Rika.

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:29.510
We might not be able to use magic like Majo Ruka...

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:33.270
But we'll try our best to take back the Maho-dou with the power we have.

00:21:33.270 --> 00:21:35.890
Yeah, but will it be enough?

00:21:35.890 --> 00:21:38.270
You're really happy though, Majo Rika.

00:21:39.730 --> 00:21:40.940
And...

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:45.060
I'm sorry about calling you a demon earlier.

00:21:45.060 --> 00:21:46.700
Ah, ya don't hafta worry 'bout that.

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:47.860
I mean it's true, ain't it?

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:48.700
Yeah!

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:50.080
What did you say!?

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:51.330
You girls are...

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:53.250
She's angry now!

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:53.930
Run fer it!

00:21:54.540 --> 00:21:56.480
Wait!

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:05.580
Ah, we just can't stand up to Majo Ruka, we ain't good enough.

00:22:05.580 --> 00:22:09.610
In that case, we should go pass the level 6 exam in the Witch World, and power up!

00:22:09.610 --> 00:22:12.740
But to get to the Witch World we have to go through the Original Maho-dou!

00:22:12.740 --> 00:22:14.540
So we hafta get through Majo Ruka?

00:22:14.540 --> 00:22:17.600
Which means there's no way we'll get there!

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:22.480
Ah! We really are world's unluckiest witch apprentices!

00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:23.980
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:23.980 --> 00:22:26.220
The Road to Being a Level 6 Witch is Long!?

00:22:26.220 --> 00:22:29.220
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
